        "quote_info": {
          "content": "SwarmBase x @Conflux_Network\n\nSwarmBase is partnering with Conflux Network to expand the autonomous agent economy into Asia.\n\nConflux is a permissionless Layer 1 with hybrid PoW/PoS consensus. Fast, secure, scalable, and the leading regulatory compliant public blockchain in China. Their partner roster speaks for itself: Shanghai government, China Telecom, Little Red Book, McDonald's China, Oreo.\n\nThrough this partnership, SwarmBase agents and the broader Swarm ecosystem gain a direct path into the Chinese and wider Asian market, leveraging Conflux's compliance posture, low fees, and zero congestion infrastructure.\n\nWhat this unlocks:\n\u2022 Asia native distribution for SwarmBase agents and builds\n\u2022 Compliance grade rails for enterprise and government deployments\n\u2022 Cross ecosystem integrations between Conflux dApps and Swarm agents\n\u2022 Joint go to market into China's regulated Web3 sector\n\nThe future of autonomous agents is global. \n\nhttps://t.co/ka8gg8I9Ny",
